LOCATION:Aula 22 Scaravilli
DESCRIPTION:No final examination. This is an administrative Pass/Fail recor
 ding session\, not a timed exam.\nComplete the required enrolment separate
 ly. Saving this reminder does not register you.\nEnrol in the lecturer's V
 irtuale course. The lecturer specified a Tuesday-midnight deadline\, but t
 he shared email does not identify the calendar date\; confirm it from the 
 original message.\nEnrol in the class named 'Esame Introduction to Economi
 cs (Crash Course)' created by the lecturer so that the Pass/Fail evaluatio
 n and corresponding credits can be recorded.\nThe lecturer confirmed no fi
 nal exam\, but did not explicitly guarantee automatic Pass for everyone. U
 niBo lists 3 CFU\; the programme handbook treats optional crash courses se
 parately from the 120 ECTS degree requirement.\nRegistration opens: 2026-1
 0-12\nRegistration closes: 2026-10-23\nSource: official UniBo listing\, in
 terpreted with the lecturer's recording notice.
